illy Center","title":"Get oriented at the Reilly Center","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Athletics and student center","notes":"Walk the building’s public corridors and check university listings for an upcoming campus event. Keep this as an orientation stop rather than assuming a game is scheduled.","short_summary":"A multipurpose campus center and home base for Bonnies athletics.","evidence_claim":"The Reilly Center is home to St. Bonaventure’s basketball and swim teams and other sports.","source_url":"https://archives.sbu.edu/buildings/Reilly_Center.html","source_title":"Reilly Center | St. Bonaventure University Archives","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Building and event access can differ by activity; consult current university event information before attending.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"bob-lanier-court","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Bob Lanier Court","title":"Recognize Bob Lanier Court","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Inside the Reilly Center","notes":"When the arena is open for an approved event, notice the named court and its place in the athletics complex. Follow event entry and seating instructions.","short_summary":"A named court within the Reilly Center’s athletics setting.","evidence_claim":"University residence-life information identifies the Reilly Center as the place where the Bonnies play on Bob Lanier Court.","source_url":"https://www.sbu.edu/life-at-sbu/housing-residence-life-and-dining/residence-life/robinson-falconio-halls","source_title":"Robinson & Falconio Halls | St. Bonaventure University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Court access is event-dependent; do not enter restricted athletics areas.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":t